  "description": "Experience love, loyalty and betrayal in a modern retelling of a classic Korean folktale. Princess Pyeonggang flees the palace, becomes an assassin and falls for Dal On, a peace-loving man. Can they fight for their love amidst lethal battles or will the forces of darkness tear them apart?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=7875&pid=webtoonguide), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9572197), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61754070), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/moonrising_river)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7160)  \nJapanese: [Piccoma](https://piccoma.com/web/product/134759), [MechaComic](https://mechacomic.jp/books/170814), [DLsite](https://www.dlsite.com/comic/work/=/product_id/BJ01098356.html), [MangaOukoku](https://comic.k-manga.jp/title/178047/pv), [Toomics](https://global.toomics.com/jp/webtoon/episode/toon/7160)",
